duct.name, unitPrice: product.price, imageUrl: product.imageUrl, variantKey: selectedVariant?.id, metadata: { size: selectedVariant?.size, color: selectedVariant?.color } })`.\n\n`frontend/src/components/review/ProductReviews.tsx` fetches and displays a list of `ReviewDto` for a given `productId` using the generated `getReviewsByProductId` service function. It also conditionally renders a `ReviewForm` if the user is authenticated and has not yet submitted a review for the product (checking via `getMyReviewForProduct`).\n\n`frontend/src/components/review/ReviewForm.tsx` allows an authenticated user to submit a review for a product. It uses `useAuth()` to get the current user's authentication status. Upon submission, it calls the generated `createReview` service function from `reviewService.ts` with the `productId`, `rating`, and `comment`. It should display a success or error toast using `sonner`.\n",
